<title>USA: Zenith Electronics provides cable technology.</title>
<headline>Zenith Electronics provides cable technology.</headline>
<dateline>GLENVIEW, Ill. 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zenith Electronics Corp said Wednesday it is providing cable television technology for the first two-way interactive system in Argentina.</p>
<p>Zenith said it plans to deliver its addressable converter system to an Argentinian cable services provider for operations scheduled to launch this spring. The company's addressable decoders are already being used in wired and wireless cable systems in Brazil, Colombia and Venezuela.</p>
<p>Zenith makes televisions and develops related technology.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading down 3/4 Wednesday at 11-1/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
